    "dynamic_image_with_text_7Fk6dY": {
      "type": "dynamic-image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_7Fk6h1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "12Ah or 18Ah Pick Your Coverage",
            "heading_size": "medium"
          }
        },
        "text_7Fk6t1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "richtext": "<p>The Mowrator S1 21″ 2WD runs on a 56V LiFePO4 battery available in two capacities. The 12Ah pack delivers up to 1.5 hours of runtime and covers up to 0.75 acre per charge ideal for smaller yards. Step up to the 18Ah pack for up to 2.25 hours and 1.125 acres per charge, built for larger properties or longer sessions. Both recharge in about 90 minutes.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_7Fk6h1",
        "text_7Fk6t1"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image_with_text.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_heading": "Choose Your Battery",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/s1-2wd-compare-2-1.webp",
        "desktop_height": "natural",
        "mobile_height": "natural",
        "desktop_width": 50,
        "desktop_image_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_image_alignment": "top",
        "text_alignment": "left"
      }
    },
    "dynamic_image_with_text_CkyrhA": {
      "type": "dynamic-image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Ckyrh1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Full Control, Every Step of the Way",
            "heading_size": "medium"
          }
        },
        "text_Ckyrt1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "richtext": "<p>Stay in command from a comfortable distance with the included handheld remote. Clear on-screen guidance lets you steer around obstacles, adjust cutting height, and switch modes without ever standing behind spinning blades. Four-point ultrasonic sensors and an automatic tilt shutoff add another layer of protection on every pass.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Ckyrh1",
        "text_Ckyrt1"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image_with_text.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_heading": "Remote Control, Real Confidence",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/ha-pc.webp",
        "desktop_height": "natural",
        "mobile_height": "natural",
        "desktop_width": 50,
        "desktop_image_alignment": "right",
        "mobile_image_alignment": "top",
        "text_alignment": "left"
      }
    },
    "dynamic_image_with_text_Q4RMwB": {
      "type": "dynamic-image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Q4RMh1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Sensors That Watch Every Angle",
            "heading_size": "medium"
          }
        },
        "text_Q4RMt1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "richtext": "<p>A four-point ultrasonic sensor array and front bumper detect obstacles before contact, while an automatic tilt sensor cuts blade power the instant the mower tips. Rated for slopes up to 45% (24°), the S1 2WD is built to handle terrain other mowers can't safely.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Q4RMh1",
        "text_Q4RMt1"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image_with_text.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_heading": "Built-In Safety, Every Slope",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_2036456531_76e9e4d8-5799-4901-be51-0f06a00c3b0d.webp",
        "desktop_height": "natural",
        "mobile_height": "natural",
        "desktop_width": 50,
        "desktop_image_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_image_alignment": "top",
        "text_alignment": "left"
